MODULE: CommitNotAccounted
TARGET: AccountingCorrect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a committed local write disappears from metered storage
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
    /\ live' = [live EXCEPT ![r] = @ + 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<scope, band, age, inbound, sample, published, slots, decision>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ live' = live
    /\ UNCHANGED <<scope, band, age, inbound, sample, published, slots, decision>>
--- END
